<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Jonah</book>
  <para style="h">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nikhat ni ah Amittai ih fapa Jonah hnenah Bawipa in hiti hin a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho awla a nasa zetmi khawlipi Nineveh ah va feh awla a sual zia va phuang aw. A ṭhat lozia hi ka hmu ṭheh a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jonah cu Pathian hnen ihsin tlan dingah Tarshish khua ah feh a tum. Joppa khua ah a vung feh ih cutawkah Tarshish feh ding lawng pakhat a hmu. Lawng man a pek ih Bawipa ih hmuh ban lonak Tarshish khua ih feh dingah lawng parah cun a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in thlipi nasa zetin a hranter ih tifinriat parah cun tilet maksak a tho ih an lawng cu a kuai ṭheh zik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawng hnaṭuantu pawl an thin a phang ngaingai ih an khawzing hnen ciar ah heh-le-heh tiah thla an cam ciamco. Cule an lawng zaang seh tiah lawng thilri tampi tidai sungah an hlon. Culai ah Jonah cu hnuaita khaan ah a rak itthat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lawng bawipa cu a ra ih, “Ziangvek minung so na si, na rak ih thah meen? Tho awla na khawzing hnenah thlacam hmeen! Na khawzing in hlohter siang loin in run ruat khal a si thei meen so khaw!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule neta bikah lawng hnaṭuantu pawl cun, “Ra hnik uh, hi tlukih kan van a siat hi zo ih ruangah so a si, camcawhfung kan zuuk hnik pei,” tiah an ti. Camcawhfung cu an zuuk ngaingai ih Jonah parah a tla riai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah a hnenah, “Hi tlukih kan van a siat hi zo ih ruangah so a si, in simhnik? Zianghna so na ṭuan? Khui ram in so na rat? Ziang miphun so na si?” tiah an suut ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonah cun an hnenah, “Hebru mi ka si ih tifinriat le leilungpi a tuahtu vancung Pathian Bawipa a biatu ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Jonah in Pathian hnen ihsin a tlan thu a sim hai tikah lawng hnaṭuantu pawl cu an ṭih sinsin ih, “Ziangah so hibangtuk thil cu na tuah?” tiah an kawk ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Thlisia dai dingah ziangtinso kan lo ti ding?” tiah an suut. Ziangahtile thlisia cu a zual deuhdeuh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Jonah cun, “Tidai sungah i hlon uhla thlisia hi a dai ding. Hitiih thlisia nasa zetih a hran hi keimah ih ruangah a si ti ka thei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lawng hnaṭuantu pawl cun leilung lam pan dingah an hlau rero naón tilet cu a nasa deuhdeuh ruangah an ti thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A netnak ah Bawipa hnenah an au ih, “Maw Bawipa , hi minung pakhat ruangah hin kan zatein in cemter siang hram hlah aw. Mawh nei lo thisen kan parah tla lo dingin in zaangfah hram aw. Maw Bawipa , nang cun na duh bangin ziang hmuahhmuah hi na cangter a si,” tiah thla an cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jonah cu an cawi ih tifinriat sungah cun an hlon; cule tilet cu a dai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah lawng hnaṭuantu pawl in Bawipa cu an ṭih ngaingai ih thawinak an pek hnuah amah rian dingin thu an kam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in Jonah dolhtu dingah ngapi a fial ih Jonah cu ngapi pum sungah ni thum le zanthum a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jonah cun ngapi pum sung ihsin Bawipa a Pathian hnenah thla a cam:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka vansaannak sungin Bawipa cu ka ko ih amah in i thei. Mithi khua ihsin bomnak ka dil, Ka aunak cu i thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah in tipi thuuk sungah i hlon, Tipi laifang tawne ahcun! Tilik in in khuh; Na tilet le na thlisia pawl cu Ka par ihsin an liam vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na mithmuh ihsin dawimi ka si ih Na Biakinn thianghlim cu ka hmu nawn lo ding, tiah ka ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kiangih tidai pawl cun ka thaw in phit; In khuh ṭheh, tipithuanthum cun! Tisung hrampi in ka lu in tuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlang saangpi hram ahcun ka pil vivo; Kotkhar in kumkhua ih hrennak ram ahcun! Asinain maw Bawipa ka Pathian, Khur sung ihsin ka nunnak cu na suah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu ka sungih a cem cuahco tikah, Bawipa cu ka hun mang sal. Ka thlacamnak na hnenah a thleng, Na Biakinn thianghlim sungah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Santlai lo milem a biatu pawl cun Pathian zaangfahnak an tlansan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kei cun na hnenah lungawinak hla thawn thawinak ka lo pe ding. Ka thukammi cu ka kimter ding, Rundamnak cu Bawipa ih hnen ihsin a ra,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ngapi a fial ih Jonah cu leilung parah a luak sal a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭong cu Jonah hnenah a ra thleng sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho awla a nasa zetmi khawlipi Nineveh ah feh aw; ka lo sim ciami vekin ka thu va phuang aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonah in Bawipa ih thu a thlun ih Nineveh khua ah a feh. Nineveh cu khua tum ngaingai a si ih khawsung cu ni thum sung feh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nikhat sung a feh ih Nineveh khua ahcun thu a sim: “Ni sawmli hnuah Nineveh khawpi hi a cem ding,” tiah a tlang-au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Nineveh khua mi pawl in Pathian an zum. Nauta bik in upa bik tiang buri hnipuan an hruk ih rawl an ul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Nineveh siangpahrang in a theih tikah a siangpahrang tokham ihsin a tho ih a lal hnipuan a hlit hnuah buri hnipuan a hruk ih vutcam lakah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Nineveh khawsung ah thu a than ih, “Nineveh siangpahrang le a tlangsuak pawl ih thuthan mi cu: Minung siseh, ṭilva siseh, caw siseh, tuu siseh zianghman nan ei lo pei; rawl nan ei lo pei ih tidai khal nan in lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minung siseh ramsa siseh, nan zatein buri hnipuan nan hruk pei ih nan aw neih patawp in Pathian nan ko pei. Zozo khal a thil sual tuahmi le a siatnak tlansan seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan hlohral ṭheh lonak dingah Pathian in a thin a sup sal ih a thinhengnak a daiter khal a si thei,” tihi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutiih an tuahmi le an nundaan ṭha lo pawl an tlansan kha Pathian in a hmuh tikah a thin a sup sal ih an parah thlenter dingih a tummi siatsuahnak cu a thlengter sal lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Jonah cu a lung a awi lo ngaingai; a thin tla a hengzet ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah hiti in thla a cam, “Maw Bawipa , himi a si kan ram ih ka rak um lai ihsin ka phanmi cu! Hi ruangah a si a hlankhan in Tarshish khua ih tlan ka rak tumnak cu! Nang cu zaangfah thiam le lainat thiam Pathian, thinsaumi le a hmunmi duhdawtnak neitu Pathian, mi siatsuah a tum hmanah a sir-aw sal ṭheutu Pathian na si ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka nunnak hi la hram aw; nun hnakin thih ka duh sawn,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Hitiih na thin a heng hi a dik na ti maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jonah cu khawsung ihsin a suak ih nisuahnak lamah a feh hnuah cunah a to. Cule a hrangah sawlhnah in deuthlam a sak ih Nineveh khua parah ziang a ra thleng ding ti zoh tum in deuthlam hnuai ah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian in uum a khoter ih Jonah phentu dingah le a harnak nuamter deuh dingah a tlun ah a zaamter. Cutikah uum ruangah Jonah cu a lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain a thaizing zingpit ah Pathian in uumhri cu sunhrul a eiter ih a vuai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni a hung suah tikah Pathian in nisuahnak lam thlisa a hranter. Cule ni in Jonah lu a em ruangah Jonah cu a lung a mit ih a sawn cuahco. Jonah cun thih a dil ih, “Nun hnakin thih ka duh sawn,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in Jonah hnenah, “Uum ruangah hiti ih na thin a heng hi a dik na ti maw si?” tiah a sut. Jonah cun, “Thih ngam in ka thin a heng hi ka dik ko a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Zan khat sungah a kho ih zan khat sungih a vuai ṭheh salmi, na phun lomi le na tuh lomi, uum hri hrangah zaangfahnak na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuti a si ahcun hi a nasa zetmi Nineveh khua, kehlam kut le vorhlam kut hman a thleidang thiam hrih lotu minung thawng zakhat le thawngkul umnak le ṭilva tla siar cawk lo umnak khua hi zaangfah lo in maw ka um ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
